2026-10-21 Kumar-Jy <20044626+Kumar-Jy@users.noreply.github.com>
	* 7.3.0-0:
	- Final release for Linux 7.3.0 with complete Xiaomi Pad 5 (nabu) hardware support
	- Graphics: bundle Adreno 640 zap shader (a640_zap.mbn) in mkinitcpio initramfs to prevent boot DRM error
	- Wireless: depend on wireless-regdb for regulatory domain database
	- SMB5: use 50 mA current steps and Type-C Rp advertising (PR #2 tvorogo)
	- FSA4480: register stub switch fallback when unpopulated on BQ25970 hardware revisions
	- Iris: SM8150 dual VCODEC power sequence, dual GDSC power domains, dual clocks, deferred OPP sequencing, zeroed queue memory
	- FastRPC SLPI: high-IOVA alias mapping and sensor PDR registration for Linux 7.3
	- Audio: SM8150 machine driver with 24-bit mic capture and quad CS35L41 amplifier routing
	- Input: Novatek NT36523 touchscreen and official Xiaomi keyboard cover lid notifier
	- Camera: OV13B10 rear + OV8856 front + CN3927 autofocus
	- Packaging: reset to final 7.3.0-0 release versioning

